{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1c26907d54b944fc","name":"Verpine Shatter Gun","source":{"id":"source:reference-1c26907d54b944fc","title":"Verpine Shatter Gun","revision":21482,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:52:40Z","sha256":"021bc7707c600d033b92e48312fc95ea5043ffd76faec75c4735a8f8fa4b5324","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21482","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Verpine%20Shatter%20Gun&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1c26907d54b944fc","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Created and produced by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Verpine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Verpine","referenceId":"reference:216c2b50aac221ae"},", the Shatter Gun is an extremely powerful but deceptively fragile handgun. Utilizing a magnetic coil, the Verpine Shatter Gun is nearly silent when fired, but it causes tremendous kinetic damage with small metallic projectiles that are accelerated to just under the speed of sound. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Verpine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Verpine","referenceId":"reference:216c2b50aac221ae"}," could increase the velocity of the projectiles, but the resulting sonic boom would be far more detrimental to the shooter than the benefit provided.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["On a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},", a Verpine Shatter Gun deals an additional 1d10 points of damage (after multiplying for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},"). Verpine Shatter Guns are extremely fragile, so if the weapon takes any damage, it is considered disabled until ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repaired"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repaired"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Verpine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Verpine","referenceId":"reference:216c2b50aac221ae"}," treat Verpine Shatter Guns as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},", rather than as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},". \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Verpine Shattergun is treated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," for the purpose of determining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", and it uses a special ammunition clip, which costs 1,000 credits for 50 shots. After 50 shots, the ammunition clip must be replaced. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 15,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Accurate:"]}," This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
